            "review_title": "Review at Boat Noodle Vincom Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "hiển long\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nTastes like a trip to Bangkok!\nOct 2025 • Solo\nBoat Noodle Vincom is like a little trip to Thailand in the middle of Saigon. The Tom Yum soup was spicy enough to wake up my soul, Pad Thai tasted like a perfect remix of sweet, sour, and savory, and the fried chicken was crispy fireworks in my mouth. Staff were super friendly and fast, and the place felt festive and fun. Five stars, and I’d gladly come back with two stomachs if I had them!\nRead more\nWritten October 3, 2025",
