            "review_text": "Sightseer59358245566\n2 contributions\n0\nHungry while with a bowl of noodles\nOct 2025 • Friends\nWhen you want to go to Thailand to eat noodles, why go far when you can have it in Saigon right at Thao Dien Vincom. Rich in flavor, spicy, sour, all have the same identity as in Thailand. If you are wondering whether to choose rice or noodles Then there's no need to hesitate when coming here because the noodles here are great and suitable for your budget and stomach. Come experience the taste of Thai boat noodles right in SG.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 3, 2025",
